  "description": "Read-only mode: the emulator simulates a server-readonly key (ServerReadOnlyPermissions). Reads, NewId() and Now() work; every write, every Call, and listing roles/keys/databases answer `permission denied` (403) at the position the server uses. Expectations were captured on fauna/faunadb:latest with a `server-readonly` key; the differential runner replays this suite with a scoped `:server-readonly` secret.",
